msgstr "这份菜单已经过期了，关掉重开一次"

# Beside an MCP row whose slot process is broken. It must not read as «switched off by hand»: the user did not do it, and the place to go is the server, not the persona.
#: windows/host/src/personas.rs:298 windows/host/src/personas_ui.rs:893
msgid "This server didn't start. Your role isn't what's withholding it."
msgstr "这个服务器没有起来。不是你的角色没给你它。"

