"This role isn't set up for any agent CLI yet. Pick one in the role library."
msgstr "这个角色还没选任何 agent CLI，请在角色库里选一个。"

#: windows/host/src/roles.rs:682
msgid "This role is set up for more than one agent CLI. Choose one."
msgstr "这个角色配了不止一个 agent CLI，请选一个。"

#: windows/host/src/roles.rs:683
msgid ""
"A tab was opened but didn't appear in time, so nothing was started in it."
msgstr "标签页已打开，但没有及时出现，所以里面什么都没启动。"

#: windows/host/src/roles.rs:684
msgid "Polter isn't ready yet."
msgstr "Polter 还没准备好。"

#: windows/host/src/roles.rs:689 windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:2893
msgid ""
"This role comes with Polter and can't be changed or deleted. Duplicate it to "
"make one of your own."
msgstr "这是 Polter 自带的角色，不能修改或删除。复制一份就能改成你自己的。"

#: windows/host/src/roles.rs:690
msgid ""
"Only you can make a role's terminal a supervisor, let it answer permission "
"prompts, or keep agents out of it."
msgstr ""
"只有你能把角色的终端设为总管、允许它回答权限提示，或把 agent 挡在它外面。"

