msgid "Key"
msgstr "Key"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:685
msgid "Lowercase letters, digits and dashes. It can't be changed after saving."
msgstr "只能用小写字母、数字和短横线，保存后不能再改。"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:687
msgid "Only lowercase letters, digits and dashes, at most 32."
msgstr "只能用小写字母、数字和短横线，最多 32 个字符。"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:695
msgid "Description"
msgstr "说明"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:696
msgid "What this role is for, for whoever picks it"
msgstr "这个角色是干什么的，写给挑选它的人看"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:699
msgid "Instructions"
msgstr "指令"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:710
msgid ""
"Added to the agent's system prompt when it starts. Leave it empty to add "
"nothing. Drag the bottom edge to make the box taller."
msgstr ""
"启动时附加到 agent 的系统提示词后面。留空就什么都不加。拖动下边缘可以把输入框"
"拉高。"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:715
msgid "Polter"
msgstr "Polter"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:716
msgid "Make this terminal a supervisor"
msgstr "将此终端设为总管"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:717
msgid "Let the supervisor answer this terminal's permission prompts"
msgstr "允许总管替你回答此终端的权限问题"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:718
msgid "Shield it: no tool can reach it, a supervisor's included"
msgstr "开启护盾：任何工具都碰不到它，总管也不行"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:720
msgid ""
"These three give the terminal something, so only you can set them, here. A "
"supervisor that edits roles can't change them."
msgstr ""
"这三项会给终端授予权限，所以只有你能在这里设置。能编辑角色的总管也改不了它"
"们。"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:723
msgid "Hand it to the supervisor to watch"
msgstr "交给总管监管"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:727
msgid ""
"The supervisor that started it, or the only one there is. With several and "
"you starting it, nobody."
msgstr ""
"交给启动它的那个总管；如果是你启动的，就交给唯一的那个总管。有多个总管时不交"
"给任何人。"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:728
msgid "Report it as still after"
msgstr "静止多久算卡住"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:736
msgid "min"
msgstr "分钟"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:741
msgid "Open in"
msgstr "打开位置"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:745
msgid "Here when at a prompt, else a new tab"
msgstr "在提示符处就地打开，否则开新标签页"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:745
msgid "Always a new tab"
msgstr "始终在新标签页中打开"

#: windows/host/src/roles_ui.rs:756
msgid ""
"Applied once, when the role starts an agent CLI. Putting the role on a "
"terminal that's already running changes its tools, not these."
msgstr ""
"只在用这个角色启动 agent CLI 时生效一次。给已经在运行的终端换上这个角色，只会"
"切换它的工具，不会改这些设置。"

